  "body": "## Summary\r\n\r\nThis PR adds support for environment markers in `exclude-dependencies`. For example, to omit GDAL on Windows:\r\n\r\n```toml\r\n[tool.uv]\r\nexclude-dependencies = [\"gdal ; sys_platform == 'win32'\"]\r\n```\r\n\r\nCloses https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/issues/17642.\r\n",
